one; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-bottom-color: windowtext;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"111\">\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">20%</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 83.65pt; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1pt; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-bottom-color: windowtext;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"111\">\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">80%</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3、平台每单抽取技师15%的广告费；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4、如果客户有使用优惠券，则平台抽取技师该单10%的费用；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5、从入驻平台起，技师工资15天结算一次。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt;\">奖惩制度</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1、客户投诉一单扣300元；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2、五星好评率低于80%重新培训。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt;\">公司福利</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1、公司不定期为过生日的合伙人举行生日宴会，公司提供聚餐、生日蛋糕、生日红包各一个；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2、公司每月会评比出接单能手，评选出前1、2、3名员工进行单独奖励，奖品不固定公司会根据情况而定。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt;\">服务用语</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1、敲门一重两轻，按门铃按两次停顿5秒后再按。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2、贵宾您好！我是</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">享享到家</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">理疗师</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">XXX，很高兴为您服务。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3、贵宾您好！您本次消费的项目是 XXX项目，时间是XX分钟，现在计时开始了，如服务中感到力度不合适请及时与我沟通。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4、贵宾您好！您本次服务已完毕，欢迎下次继续支持我，请对我本次服务进行评价，谢谢！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5、服务过程中请用（对不起、打扰了、请稍等、谢谢您）等语言。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 15pt;\">安全制度</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、公司合伙人禁止打架斗殴，违者罚款&nbsp;500元~1000 元每次，情节严重者解除合作关系并移交公安机关处理；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、技师在服务过程禁止做公司无关的项目，因此导致的后果均自行负责；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、技师接单出行，必须按交通规则出行，不得抢道、闯红灯、翻越栏杆；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、技师不得殴打客人，违者一次罚款500元~1000 元，情节严重者解除合作关系并移交公安机关处理；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5、如与客人发生骚扰、强奸、打架等过激事件时，利用一切可保护资源保护自己，第一时间求救（拨打&nbsp;110、拨打公司客服热线、管理人员电话、或者直接跑出门口求救、就近寻找顾客以外的其他人员、学会观察环境、如发现事态不对第一时间往门口跑、在酒店客房可选择大声呼救、选择易碎响声比较大的物品炸碎求救、拨打酒店前台热线）等方式；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6、不得偷盗、私用客人、公司、同事的财物和物品，违者罚款500元~1000 元，情节严重者解除合作关系并移交公安机关处理；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7、公司合伙人不得与客人私下勾兑交易与公司无关的项目，其所产生的法律责任及经济纠纷均自行负责；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8、公司严禁黄、赌、毒，违者开除并移交公安机关处理；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9、公司安全制度要牢记，时刻保护好自身人生安全。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '技师服务协议');
