itial;\">享享到家</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&rdquo;之意见及观点，也不意味着赞同其观点或证实其内容的真实性。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 18.0000pt; background: #ffffff; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3、&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">享享到家</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&rdquo;转载的文字、图片、音视频等资料均由本APP用户提供，其真实性、准确性和合法性由信息发布人负责。&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">享享到家</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&rdquo;不提供任何保证，并不承担任何法律责任。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p